WEBVTT

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:35.110
Potemayo's first allowance.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.110
A total of 300 yen.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:44.840
That's impossible.

00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:49.200
That's even more impossible.

00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:49.200
TL - 80,000,000

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:56.570
Shopping

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:00.550
Do you want to try and go shopping alone, Pote?

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:04.040
You were able to do it alone during the festival too.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:05.140
Want to try it?

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:12.890
I see. If you see anything you like while out shopping, you can buy it.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.520
A change of pants.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:32.720
I'm not sure but it seems she's really into it.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:35.700
Shopping memo.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:36.970
Money.

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:38.480
Lost child necklace.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.290
A change of pants.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.530
Alright, good luck.

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.180
Be careful.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:54.520
Yams for sale. Delicious yams.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:58.680
Good luck!

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:08.510
What's this?

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:10.120
A jigsaw puzzle.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:14.490
Why do we have to do this on our rare Sundays?

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:15.620
To kill time.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:17.860
I'm sure there are other things to do.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:18.910
There isn't.

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:22.780
If we had some spending money we'd be able to go watch a movie or go to a cafe.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.910
We're here at the park because we don't have any.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:28.150
Even so, we don't have to do <i>this</i>.

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:30.240
You  have nothing else to do, right?

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:35.500
I'm sure we can do it if we combine all 3 of our powers.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:36.720
You're going to do it?

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.480
Hold it!

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:05.670
Give me back those chestnuts!

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:08.030
Are you listening!?

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:10.960
Who are you?

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.350
What are you doing? Let's get her!

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:31.030
Just endure the pain!

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:38.320
Hey, hold it, chestnut thief!

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:19.250
Hold it!

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.780
Just three more pieces!

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.320
We finally got this far!

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:34.710
This isn't useful to us at all but there's a feeling of achievement!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.070
Wait!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:55.890
Let's finish it here!

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.930
Picking up all those pieces was a real hassle, huh?

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.560
Let's start then.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:22.580
You're going to do it again?

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:47.330
Hold it!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.820
In Search of Lost Time - Marcel Proust

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.390
Let's go, kid!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.370
Keep going, kid! Get her!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.690
Are you okay, kid!?

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.190
Get it together, kid!

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:51.650
She got away in the end, huh?

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:26.180
Chestnuts!

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:29.960
Oh, amazing! These are big chestnuts.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:33.110
I wonder if we can eat them? Let's try and roast one.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:40.390
Is this your thanks for the festival? You don't really need to worry about it though. Okay?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.990
I feel bad having so much.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:50.360
They really look good. I'm sure there are a lot of people who want some.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:03.730
I can't tell her to give the chestnuts back after seeing that.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:07.690
Well, I'll let it go this time.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.420
That's right, compassion!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:15.020
By the way, what are you and that girl from before?

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:16.260
Are you human?

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:24.420
I see. If you can wear pants yourself, then you must be human.

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:29.180
By the way, that's not one. It's an animal.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.820
It's just spoiled.

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:35.740
Things to buy - band aids - 210 yen

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:35.760
You're running errands?

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:36.910
You're a good girl.

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:42.760
If you want to buy this, go straight and then turn right. There's a convenience store there.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.650
Be careful, okay, kid?

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:47.060
Here.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:01.100
Hey! Go right! Right!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.880
Wait, persimmon thief!

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:26.300
Just three more pieces!

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:28.730
We finally got this far!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:32.020
Picking up all those pieces was a real hassle, huh?

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:33.960
Let's go then.

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:34.870
Wait.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:36.760
Let's check our surroundings.

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:39.390
Right's okay.

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:42.360
Left's okay.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:44.550
Well then...

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:47.190
Hold it!

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:50.830
They're here again!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:14.740
Hey! You can't take things from other peoples' homes!

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.240
You'll become a thief!

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:31.220
You understand now?

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:36.930
I'll take this back so don't steal things again!

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:58.590
Was it a bit too early for her to go shopping?

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:03.810
Are you a kid from the Moriyama residence?

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:04.610
Yes.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:07.760
I saw her lost child necklace so I'm brought her here.

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:11.300
She fell asleep holding onto the bread.

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:16.360
She must be tired. Our store is pretty far from here.

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:20.610
This is from the store I said was delicious.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:22.660
Did she get this for me?

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:24.490
Well then...

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:28.990
Special delivery bread, 420 yen!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:49.150
Bread! B-Bread! Bread!

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:51.370
Thanks.

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:54.770
You bought this for me, right?

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:58.010
The bread there is good.

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:01.790
Here, you forgot this.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:09.140
Potemayo.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:14.400
That baker said it was service day so he only charged 100 yen.

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:16.280
Aren't you glad?

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.720
I'm going now.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.160
What is this!?

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:36.470
An apology.

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.370
Good morning!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.100
Morning!

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:04.210
This'll be the coldest morning yet this year so everybody make sure to dress up well before heading out.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:07.590
And following is today's Lucky Fortune-telling.

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:25.630
Hey, Yasumi! How long are you going to stay in the toilet?

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:29.830
Yasumi!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.910
Why?

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:43.180
Today's a lot colder, huh, Pote?

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:46.000
The glass is all frosted.

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.830
Here's your after-meal, coffee.

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:10.810
Thanks.

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:13.860
Did you sleep well last night?

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.330
Yes, really well.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.200
But it's the same as ever, huh?

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:21.770
Today's really cold, Nene-tan!

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:23.800
Do you want to take you there with the car?

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:25.060
That's unfair, Umezo!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.880
You like my car better, right!?

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:28.450
What are you saying? Mine's better! Mine!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:31.010
Mine's better of course! Mine! Mine! Mine!

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.790
I guess I'll go by car.

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:34.580
Bring the car about, Umezo.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:39.200
No way, Nene-tan! Take my car! Mine! Mine!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.300
Phone!

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:42.800
Here it is.

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:44.710
Huh? Are you calling an ambulance?

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.720
I'll call one for you then, Nene-tan!

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:51.900
Go!

00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:01.000
It's just like an angel.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:02.680
Is it going to snow?

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.750
That was an amazing drift...

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:06.010
Ai.

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:06.600
Here.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:07.500
Ikeda.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.270
Here.

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:09.090
Etoh.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:09.890
Here.

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:10.700
Kaji.

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:11.190
Here.

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:12.270
Kasugano.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:12.900
Here.

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:13.810
Kirihara.

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:15.250
Kirihara?

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.630
What? You're sure late.

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:26.620
Geez! What the heck were you thinking? I thought I was going to die!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.250
Hey! You say something too!

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:36.040
I...I...

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:39.360
If I'm with Mutan, I wouldn't mind dying.

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:41.010
Mutan!

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:44.120
...or something like that.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.400
That was just like him!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.810
Don't say such weird things!

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:50.880
She was right on the mark.

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:58.740
It's cold today so let's eat in the nurse's office.

00:16:59.000 --> 00:16:59.730
Yeah.

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:03.200
That Kasugano really pisses me off.

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:05.580
She keeps playing around with people.

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:08.690
But you gave that chocolate to the wrong person, right?

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.840
Shouldn't you say something to her then?

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:15.800
Keep it a secret.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:17.760
Okay.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:26.370
Well... she said if I opposed her she'd tell everyone that I really like Pote-tan.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:31.020
But everyone knows that already.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:40.580
But I believe that if I keep with these feelings, they'll eventually reach her.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:43.450
Su-nao. Suna-o.

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:46.020
Pote-tan!

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:49.820
See?

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:53.350
Pote-tan!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:55.940
Mutan...!

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.560
It's snowing! Snowing!

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:04.830
They did say that it might snow today.

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:06.900
It's going to really pile up.

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:15.930
Hey, hey! You're all in the middle of class. Concentrate!

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:23.490
Stop it, principal! You're not a kid anymore and please wear your jacket!

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:23.520
It's snowing! Snowing, teacher!

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:25.750
Principal!

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:27.230
Snow, snow, snow!

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:34.620
It's really piled up now.

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:36.720
Let's dash out when the chime rings.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:37.510
Yeah!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:51.450
A red sun lunch?

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:51.450
Note: Think of the Japanese flag.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:53.310
Pote-chan!

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:53.310
Pote!

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:59.310
Make sure to check your surroundings before acting from now on, okay?

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:02.200
Chick.

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:04.330
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.270
It really piled up.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.860
It's been a while since it snowed this much.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:15.500
It's freaking cold and what's so fun about looking at snow?

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:18.260
It <i>is</i> fun because it snowed.

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:21.830
And you can have fun like this too.

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:27.210
I'm gonna get you back!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:32.960
Take this!

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:48.990
Mutan!

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:51.580
Guchuko?

00:19:56.660 --> 00:20:00.110
Stop! Stop, Guchuko! It's just a snowball fight!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.080
It's just a game, okay?

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:19.300
Nene! Guchuko!

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:37.610
What's with you two? You're both having fun.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.390
Stop them already!

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:43.100
Hold it!

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:49.190
Hey! Change into your jerseys or you'll catch a cold!

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:50.400
Yes!

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:54.020
We're all soaked.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:56.700
It can't be helped since it's packing snow.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:06.750
Here.

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:12.520
Dry your hair properly.

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:19.050
What is it?

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:21.040
Hand over your jersey too!

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:29.860
Did you two forget your jerseys?

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:31.420
You'll catch a cold.

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:33.140
Warm and cozy.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:35.920
Did you rest up?

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.400
Don't do something like that again.

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:43.410
You left your change of clothes back in the classroom, huh?

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:46.100
Alright...

00:21:48.150 --> 00:21:49.110
Come in here.

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:50.900
Naked with just a jersey.
